    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987400/extras/f330027f0fdc40eb50975ce6ebc484af.poster.avif?t=1753456053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987400/extras/f330027f0fdc40eb50975ce6ebc484af.webm?t=1753456053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987400/extras/c52940d1b711a5e85b0d0e1c50055733.poster.avif?t=1753456053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987400/extras/c52940d1b711a5e85b0d0e1c50055733.webm?t=1753456053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>He's right behind you in every step you take. You should stay hidden and evade him during the whole journey while also solving the puzzles along the way. You have no super powers, only mere equipments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987400/extras/e4671036eba3e592c844c63f4363da30.poster.avif?t=1753456053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987400/extras/e4671036eba3e592c844c63f4363da30.webm?t=1753456053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Put yourself in shoes of Adrian, and try to rescue your mother from being sacrificied by the Aztec god. Learn about secrets of Aztec history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987400/extras/9eeb1a46514a09f4002ee54a558e70b1.poster.avif?t=1753456053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987400/extras/9eeb1a46514a09f4002ee54a558e70b1.webm?t=1753456053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Powered by Unreal Engine 5's latest technologies, immerse yourself in a mansion which was host to an Aztec god for decades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987400/extras/f330027f0fdc40eb50975ce6ebc484af.poster.avif?t=1753456053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987400/extras/f330027f0fdc40eb50975ce6ebc484af.webm?t=1753456053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987400/extras/c52940d1b711a5e85b0d0e1c50055733.poster.avif?t=1753456053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987400/extras/c52940d1b711a5e85b0d0e1c50055733.webm?t=1753456053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>He's right behind you in every step you take. You should stay hidden and evade him during the whole journey while also solving the puzzles along the way. You have no super powers, only mere equipments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987400/extras/e4671036eba3e592c844c63f4363da30.poster.avif?t=1753456053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987400/extras/e4671036eba3e592c844c63f4363da30.webm?t=1753456053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Put yourself in shoes of Adrian, and try to rescue your mother from being sacrificied by the Aztec god. Learn about secrets of Aztec history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987400/extras/9eeb1a46514a09f4002ee54a558e70b1.poster.avif?t=1753456053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987400/extras/9eeb1a46514a09f4002ee54a558e70b1.webm?t=1753456053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Powered by Unreal Engine 5's latest technologies, immerse yourself in a mansion which was host to an Aztec god for decades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>",
    "short_description": "Get ready to see life through the eyes of a young man trying to escape Xipe Totec an ancient deity venerated across Mesoamerican civilizations and later embraced by the Aztecs. A chaotic experience full of horror and survival mechanics\u00a0awaits.",
